## Recommended Next Steps

Write this as a theorem with the exact common Borel seed/state policy model first. Then prove the four bridge lemmas in order: seed-to-prefix kernels, completed-to-Borel versions, Borel implementation by uniforms, and weak-star compactness. Keep the final statement finite-grid and reward-coordinate-only.
